 "$dB=\\dfrac{\\mu_0}{4\\pi}\\dfrac{I\\,ds\\sin\\theta}{r^2}$, finite straight wire $B=\\dfrac{\\mu_0I}{4\\pi d}(\\sin\\theta_2-\\sin\\theta_1)$ | $dB=\\dfrac{\\mu_0}{4\\pi}\\dfrac{I\\,ds\\sin\\theta}{r^2}$, dây thẳng hữu hạn $B=\\dfrac{\\mu_0I}{4\\pi d}(\\sin\\theta_2-\\sin\\theta_1)$",
